{
	"id": 74681,
	"type": "WQ",
	"name": "特技光效與明日之星！",
	"description": "#在「千靈映影節」的會場，某位衣著華麗的「實驗映影」導演向{F#妳}{M#你}們發出了真誠的邀請…",
	"unlockDescription": "",
	"chapter": "",
	"showType": "QUEST_SHOW",
	"activityId": 2027,
	"mainQuestTag": "MAINQUEST_TAG_GUIDE",
	"suggestTrackMainQuestList": [],
